---
/* Four blueprint corner marks. Place inside any `position: relative` element;
   each mark centers on a corner. Styling lives in globals.css (.crosshair-mark)
   so it can be shared with rehype-injected post images. */
---

<span class="crosshair-mark crosshair-mark--tl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span class="crosshair-mark crosshair-mark--tr" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span class="crosshair-mark crosshair-mark--bl" aria-hidden="true"></span>
<span class="crosshair-mark crosshair-mark--br" aria-hidden="true"></span>
